# Knife Slot + Air Dash — Design

Date: 2026-09-27 · Branch: `feat/melee-dash` · Status: approved in brainstorm, pending spec review

## Goal

Give every player an always-carried knife on key 3 whose alt-fire (right
click) is a one-charge air dash. The knife is the melee identity; the dash is
its mobility verb. Hero-shooter rules apply (memory `gunplay_direction`):
movement never costs accuracy, balance lives in damage / rate / charges.

## Decisions (from brainstorm)

| Topic | Decision |
|---|---|
| Melee weapon | New knife slot; guns remain primary/secondary |
| Knife ownership | One knife for now, addressed by id; collectable/personal knives are a later project (save data) |
| Placeholder model | Procedural (primitive meshes), ~0.30 m |
| Moveset | New fast stab — not SwordCombat's Joust |
| Stab | 45 dmg (×1.5 head zone = 67.5), 0.45 s interval, 2.2 m reach, backstab kills |
| Dash key | Right click (`knife_dash`), rebindable |
| Dash availability | Air only, knife out |
| Recharge | 1 charge, refills on landing or wall-run start |
| Dash shape | 22 m/s for 0.15 s (~3.3 m burst) along camera look incl. pitch; gravity paused |
| Exit speed | Horizontal clamped to 16 m/s (bhop ceiling), upward clamped to 10.5 (jump speed), then normal air physics |
| Ground dash | None (slide is the ground burst) |
| Per-weapon | Dash numbers live on the knife def so later knives can differ |
| HUD | Diamond pip under reticle, knife-only |
| Keys | Knife = 3; camera toggle 3 → V |
| Architecture | Approach A: knife is a `GunDef` with `FireMode.Melee` inside GunCombat |

## 1. Knife (GunCombat.cs)

- `FireMode.Melee`, `GunSlot.Melee`.
- `GunDef` gains `BackstabKills` (bool) and `DashSpeed` (22), `DashDur`
  (0.15), `DashExitCap` (16).
- `Defs["knife"]`: Mode Melee, Slot Melee, Damage 45, FireInterval 0.45,
  Range 2.2, MagSize 0, RecoilKick small, IsPistol true, AnimFamily
  "pistol", BackstabKills true, Model = `res://scenes/weapons/KnifePlaceholder.tscn`,
  TrueLength 0.30. Not in `StarterPool` or `ArenaPool`.
- Melee `Fire`: no ammo decrement, no muzzle flash / casing / tracer / auto
  reload. Sphere sweep (radius 0.3) along the camera ray to Range; first body
  with PlayerHealth that is an opponent (same team rule as `TallyHit`) is hit.
  Damage = Damage × zone mult (existing head/legs zones), or
  `PlayerHealth.MaxHealth` (÷ DamageMultiplier, as the AWP rule does) when
  `BackstabKills` and the attacker is within ±60° behind the target's facing.
  Facing: `PlayerController.ForwardVector` for players/puppets, `-Basis.Z`
  for other bodies. Damage goes through `DeliverDamage` (relay, hitmarker,
  numbers unchanged). `OnShotEndpoint` still fires (hit point or reach end).
- Melee guards: `RequestReload` ignored; `IsEmpty` false; `SwitchTo` never
  auto-reloads a melee weapon; `AmmoFraction` reads 1.

## 2. Model

`scenes/weapons/KnifePlaceholder.tscn` — Node3D root with blade / guard /
grip MeshInstance3D boxes, blade along local +X (Styloo convention), steel +
dark grip materials. Tracked in git (not `assets/`, which is gitignored). The
existing FP/TP gun pipeline (`RebuildFpGun` / `RebuildTpGun`, TrueLength
scaling, grip seating) loads it via `Model`. Swapping in a real knife later
= change `Model`.

## 3. Slot + input (PlayerController.cs, minimal)

- `MeleeGunId = "knife"` set in `EquipStarterGun` (spawn loadout).
- `SelectMelee()` → existing `SelectGun` (so `WeaponSwitched` relays it).
- `weapon_melee` action handled next to `weapon_primary/secondary`.
- `CycleWeapon` ring includes the knife as a third stop.
- Puppet shot handler: skip tracer when the def is Melee.
- FP stab visual: on a melee `OnFired`, a short forward thrust of the arms
  (placeholder until knife clips exist) plus the pistol shoot one-shot.

## 4. Dash (PlayerController.cs, one self-contained block)

Fields `_dashCharge`, `_dashLeft`, `_dashDir`; property `DashReady`.

1. Refill: `if (onFloor || _wallRunning) _dashCharge = true;`
2. Start: `knife_dash` just pressed && knife held && !onFloor &&
   !_wallRunning && !_sliding && _dashCharge → `_dashDir` = camera forward,
   `_dashLeft = DashDur`, charge spent, FOV kick.
3. Burst: after the `WallRunTick/SlideTick/NormalTick` dispatch, while
   `_dashLeft > 0`: `vel = _dashDir * DashSpeed`.
4. End (timer out, landed, or wall run started): clamp horizontal to
   `DashExitCap`, clamp upward Y to `JumpSpeed`.

Not touched: NormalTick, WallRunTick, SlideTick, momentum/bhop/wall-run/air
constants. Dash-into-wall flows into the normal `TryStartWallRun`.

## 5. HUD (PlayerHUD.cs)

- `DashPip`: 7 px diamond, 18 px below reticle, knife-only; ready = warm
  white, spent = grey ~25% alpha; one scale pulse on refill.
- Ammo label shows `KNIFE` for melee; reload ring never shows.
- WeaponSlotsPanel: third card for the knife (GunSlotIcon renders the model).

## 6. Input map + rebind screen

- `project.godot`: add `weapon_melee` (physical 3), `knife_dash` (mouse
  right); `toggle_camera` 3 → V.
- `SettingsPanel.BindableActions`: add "Melee Weapon", "Knife Dash".
- Saved binds store only overrides, so defaults flow to existing players.
  Known edge: a player who explicitly saved camera-toggle = 3 gets 3 doing
  both until they rebind; accepted, no migration.

## 7. Docs

CLAUDE.md pillar: third person toggle on V; knife on 3, right-click air
