## 8. Verification

- `test/TestKnife`: 45 dmg in range, miss past 2.2 m, backstab kills, front
  stab doesn't, knife ⇄ gun swap never reloads, knife in no pool.
- `test/TestKnifeDash`: real PlayerController — dash ≈ 3.3 m burst, exit
  horizontal ≤ 16, no second air dash, refill on land, no ground dash, no
  dash with a gun out.
- Re-run TestGunSlots, TestLoadoutSlots, TestGunTuning, TestHitMarker.
- `dotnet build` clean. Capture of FP/TP knife + pip, windowed on the
  second monitor (not the one running League).

## Out of scope

Knife ownership/collecting, knife animation clips, knife move-speed bonus,
dash sound (unless an existing SFX fits), ground dash.
